{"4434380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blackout Route", "steam_appid": 4434380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5116550, 5120190], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Signal controls the world. You are part of the Resistance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/360f6cee7cbf2a83b07557bc0795efe6.poster.avif?t=1788259118\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/360f6cee7cbf2a83b07557bc0795efe6.webm?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/360f6cee7cbf2a83b07557bc0795efe6.mp4?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHUT DOWN THE SIGNAL — AND MAKE IT BACK.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective of every raid is to locate and shut down a Signal belonging to the Synchronization Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Signal is disabled, the Network detects your presence and activates its destruction protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every raid takes you to a new location where Signals are still active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ROUTE AND VENTURE INTO INFECTED ZONES.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/acf0aef10550f02a81b06b44958c6dc2.poster.avif?t=1788259118\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/acf0aef10550f02a81b06b44958c6dc2.webm?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/acf0aef10550f02a81b06b44958c6dc2.mp4?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>THE CAMP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Resistance’s base of operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can sell the loot you find to traders, salvage resources, craft new gear, and prepare for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and defend your base against raids by the Network’s Agents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/cde9fe2cb3800f84079c5aaaf2eaff5a.poster.avif?t=1788259118\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/cde9fe2cb3800f84079c5aaaf2eaff5a.webm?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/cde9fe2cb3800f84079c5aaaf2eaff5a.mp4?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Synchronization Network never forgets those who interfere with its operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the Signals will track down your hideout, and Network Agents will attack your camp — forcing you to defend everything you’ve built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your base and be ready for an assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE RESISTANCE STARTS WITH YOU.</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Signal controls the world. You are part of the Resistance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/360f6cee7cbf2a83b07557bc0795efe6.poster.avif?t=1788259118\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/360f6cee7cbf2a83b07557bc0795efe6.webm?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/360f6cee7cbf2a83b07557bc0795efe6.mp4?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHUT DOWN THE SIGNAL — AND MAKE IT BACK.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective of every raid is to locate and shut down a Signal belonging to the Synchronization Network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the Signal is disabled, the Network detects your presence and activates its destruction protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every raid takes you to a new location where Signals are still active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ROUTE AND VENTURE INTO INFECTED ZONES.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/acf0aef10550f02a81b06b44958c6dc2.poster.avif?t=1788259118\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/acf0aef10550f02a81b06b44958c6dc2.webm?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/acf0aef10550f02a81b06b44958c6dc2.mp4?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>THE CAMP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the Resistance’s base of operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can sell the loot you find to traders, salvage resources, craft new gear, and prepare for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and defend your base against raids by the Network’s Agents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/cde9fe2cb3800f84079c5aaaf2eaff5a.poster.avif?t=1788259118\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/cde9fe2cb3800f84079c5aaaf2eaff5a.webm?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/extras/cde9fe2cb3800f84079c5aaaf2eaff5a.mp4?t=1788259118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Synchronization Network never forgets those who interfere with its operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the Signals will track down your hideout, and Network Agents will attack your camp — forcing you to defend everything you’ve built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your base and be ready for an assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE RESISTANCE STARTS WITH YOU.</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br></p>", "short_description": "The world has been taken over by the Synchronization Network. A co-op action horror game with crafting, scavenging, and extraction. Venture into dangerous zones, disable Signals, rescue survivors, gather resources, and make it back to camp alive.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Thai, Turkish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/6a13a04a677b75f09f4527337630aa3258221802/header.jpg?t=1788259118", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4434380/2fb7d0103f46cf7e7a090ec80ad69c1f9f0aa024/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788259118", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.s